@startuml figma-design-sync-architecture
!include ../../../../docs/uml/includes/theme.puml
!include ../../../../docs/uml/includes/stereotypes.puml

title figmaDesignSync architecture

skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 140

component "domain\n--\nProject model\nModule model\nPorts" as domainPackage <<domain>>
component "data\n--\nGradle readers\nCatalog readers\nVersion readers\nFigma client" as dataPackage <<adapter>>
component "plugin\n--\nGradle plugin\nTasks\nModel generation\nDI component" as pluginPackage <<gradle>>
artifact "design-model.json" as designModel <<artifact>>
component "tools\n--\nMCP app\nSync use case\nFigma gateways" as toolsPackage <<figma>>
cloud "Figma file" as figmaFile <<figma>>

domainPackage --> dataPackage : flow\nDomain contracts define model and ports
dataPackage --> pluginPackage : flow\nAdapters read Gradle, catalogs,\nversions, and Figma metadata
pluginPackage --> designModel : flow\nGradle tasks export the versioned\nFigma design model
designModel --> toolsPackage : flow\nGenerated JSON enters the MCP\nsync runtime
toolsPackage --> figmaFile : flow\nMCP gateways update visual\ncomponents in Figma

dataPackage ..> domainPackage : dependency\n`data` implements `domain` ports
pluginPackage ..> domainPackage : dependency\n`plugin` uses the shared model
pluginPackage ..> dataPackage : dependency\n`plugin` reuses concrete adapters
toolsPackage ..> designModel : runtime dependency\n`tools` consumes generated JSON

@enduml
